{"meta":{"id":"tt0332452","type":"movie","name":"Troya","imdb_id":"tt0332452","description":"Paris, hijo de Príamo y príncipe de Troya, rapta a Helena, esposa de Menelao, el rey de Esparta, lo que desencadena la Guerra de Troya, en la que se enfrentan griegos y troyanos. El ejército griego asedió la ciudad de Troya durante más de diez años. Aquiles era el gran héroe de los griegos, mientras Héctor, el hijo mayor de Príamo, el rey de Troya, representaba la única esperanza de salvación para la ciudad.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0332452.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ZPcC5hJh21QiW0jmhMQhZeSoGu.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A2LtEwGpzUJZ3jyhFR2wSlW4THX.png","genres":["Acción","Aventura"],"releaseInfo":"2004","released":"2004-05-13T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"163 min","imdbRating":"7.3","country":"United Kingdom, United States","cast":["Brad Pitt","Orlando Bloom","Eric Bana","Brian Cox","Sean Bean","Brendan Gleeson","Diane Kruger","Peter O'Toole","Rose Byrne","Saffron Burrows","Garrett Hedlund","Vincent Regan","Julie Christie","Nathan Jones","Mark Lewis Jones","John Shrapnel","James Cosmo","Nigel Terry","Julian Glover","Trevor Eve","Frankie Fitzgerald","Lucie Barat","Siri Svegler","Ken Bones","Manuel Cauchi","Owain Yeoman","Tyler Mane","Louis Dempsey","Joshua Richards","Tim Chipping"],"director":["Wolfgang Petersen"],"writer":["David Benioff","Enfys Dickinson"],"trailers":[{"source":"ORKSndBYAPk","type":"Trailer","name":"Troya - Trailer Oficial Español - mivideo.club","ytId":"ORKSndBYAPk","lang":"es"},{"source":"P8xLgg-MNKw","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"P8xLgg-MNKw","lang":"en"},{"source":"SalHFAZVxAg","type":"Trailer","name":"Original Trailer","ytId":"SalHFAZVxAg","lang":"en"},{"source":"6FG3BfPuwBA","type":"Trailer","name":"Original Theatrical Trailer","ytId":"6FG3BfPuwBA","lang":"en"},{"source":"ekshABiptOY","type":"Trailer","name